{"id": "EUVD-2026-103456", "enisaUuid": "3ccc7346-013e-3ec6-8c14-a6137cb36d74", "description": "ProjectSend 2.0.0 before 2.7.0 contains a path validation flaw in OrphanFileScanner::isOrphan() that allows staff with import_orphans permission to treat tracked files as orphans. Attackers can submit ./ path aliases to the orphans import or delete endpoints, deleting or adopting other owners' files while bypassing delete_others_files.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T11:38:27", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T18:41:57", "baseScore": 6.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/projectsend/projectsend/security/advisories/GHSA-pv88-7863-5hwq", "https://github.com/projectsend/projectsend/commit/1e34773ad39c256f1320f4d2b47b93a5805f07c6", "https://github.com/projectsend/projectsend/releases/tag/v2.7.0", "https://github.com/projectsend/projectsend/blob/v2.6.0/app/Modules/Files/OrphanFileScanner.php#L109-L120", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/projectsend-2.0.0-before-2.7.0-path-validation-bypass-via-orphan-file-import-delete"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112003", "GHSA-f5fh-phpc-hrv4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.36, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "884ad317-acd7-3da9-9229-bf2be06f3e53", "product": {"name": "ProjectSend", "vendor": {"name": "projectsend"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a0b825e7-7252-3648-9255-8c1eb80be304", "vendor": {"name": "projectsend"}}], "isExploited": false}